* NOTE: every event in the timeline below happens 10 ms LATER in this file (imbalance from 20 ms, stop at 31 ms),
* because start-up with 33 uF had not finished by 10 ms.
* P6b - As P6_rail_tracking.net, with the 14 Nov changes: setpoint 102 V, 33 uF per rail,
* slope ramp 46 mV (40 mV internal + 200 ohm external [calc]), and an idealized over-voltage clamp on EACH rail
* at 109.8 V that pulls COMP down (stands in for a TL431 + optocoupler per rail) [ASSUME gain].
* P6 - Rail tracking check for decision P-6, option C:
* ONE idealized peak-current-mode controller and ONE switch drive TWO catalogue transformers
* with their primaries in parallel. T1 feeds +HV (regulated), T2 feeds -HV (follows, unregulated).
* Question: do the rails track (start-up, load imbalance, shutdown), and what happens when one
* output rectifier fails open?  Limit to compare against: rails under 110 V (D5 SMBJ100CA, 111 V min).
* Controller: same idealized LM5155 as L3_real_parts.net (thresholds from the TI model), plus
*   slope compensation 40 mV per period [ASSUME] because this design runs CCM above 50 % duty,
*   soft start 6 ms [ASSUME], and an ideal gm error amp on +HV instead of the TL431/opto network.
* Transformers: 10 uH, 1:10, k = 0.99 (2 % leakage) [DS summary, Coilcraft DA2034-AL, unconfirmed];
*   worst-case mismatch +10 % / -10 % [H]; winding resistance 15 mohm / 1.5 ohm [ASSUME].
* Switch is ideal (10 mohm) for speed; clamp and diode models are from L3.
*
* RUN 1: 9 V, no fault     RUN 2: 9 V, -HV rectifier opens at 10 ms
* RUN 3: 9 V, +HV rectifier opens at 10 ms (regulated rail lost)     RUN 4: 12.6 V, no fault
* Timeline (RUN 1 and 4): 0-6 ms soft start, idle load 91 mA per rail; 10-14 ms +80 mA on +HV only;
*   14-18 ms +80 mA on -HV only; 18-21 ms +80 mA on both (171 mA each); 21 ms controller stops.

.param RUN=1
.param VIN=if(RUN==4,12.6,9)
.param FLT=if(RUN==2,1,if(RUN==3,2,0))
.param VSET=102

* ---------- input ----------
Vin IN 0 {VIN}
Cin IN 0 141u Rser=5m

* ---------- idealized controller, 250 kHz ----------
Vvcc VCC_PIN 0 5
Vclk CLK0 0 PULSE(0 1 0 5n 5n 120n 4u)
Bclk CLK 0 V=if(time<31m,V(CLK0),0)
Vdmax DMX 0 PULSE(0 1 3.72u 5n 5n 260n 4u)
Vramp RAMP 0 PULSE(0 46m 0 3.98u 10n 0 4u)
Bvth VTH 0 V=min(max(V(COMP_PIN)/7-0.17,0),0.1)
Sset Q VCC_PIN CLK 0 SWL
Brst RST 0 V=if((((V(CS_PIN)+V(RAMP)>V(VTH))|(V(CS_PIN)>0.1))&(V(CLK)<0.5))|(V(DMX)>0.5)|(time>31m),1,0)
Srst Q 0 RST 0 SWL
Cq Q 0 10p
Rq Q 0 1G
.model SWL SW(Ron=10 Roff=1G Vt=0.5 Vh=-0.1)
Bdrv GDRV 0 V=if(V(Q)>2.5,5,0)

* ideal gm error amp on +HV with soft start; COMP clamps as in L3
Bref VREF 0 V=min(2.5,2.5*time/6m)
Bfb VFB 0 V=V(HVP)*2.5/{VSET}
Bea 0 COMP_PIN I=min(max(200u*(V(VREF)-V(VFB)),-200u),200u)
Bovp COMP_PIN 0 I=min(max(20m*(V(HVP)*2.5/109.8-2.5),0),1m)+min(max(20m*(-V(HVN)*2.5/109.8-2.5),0),1m)
Rc COMP_PIN COMP_MID 100k
Cc COMP_MID 0 3.9n
Cp COMP_PIN 0 82p
Dcl_hi COMP_PIN CLHI DCL
Vcl_hi CLHI 0 2.5
Dcl_lo CLLO COMP_PIN DCL
Vcl_lo CLLO 0 1.1
.model DCL D(Is=1e-14 N=1)

* ---------- two transformers, primaries in parallel ----------
L1p IN DRAIN 11u Rser=15m
L1s 0 SP 1.1m Rser=1.5
K1 L1p L1s 0.99
L2p IN DRAIN 9u Rser=15m
L2s HVN SN 0.9m Rser=1.5
K2 L2p L2s 0.99

* ---------- switch, clamp, current sense ----------
S1 DRAIN SENSE GDRV 0 SWM
.model SWM SW(Ron=10m Roff=10Meg Vt=2.5 Vh=0)
Coss DRAIN 0 300p
Rsnub IN SNUB 100
Csnub IN SNUB 100n
Dsnub DRAIN SNUB D_SNUB
Rsns SENSE 0 6m
Rcs SENSE CS_PIN 100
Ccs CS_PIN 0 470p

* ---------- +HV output (regulated) ----------
Bfp FPC 0 V=if((FLT==2)&(time>20m),0,1)
Sfp SP SPD FPC 0 SWF
Dp SPD HVP D_SEC
Coutp HVP 0 33u Rser=20m
Rlp HVP 0 1143
Bsp SPC 0 V=if((FLT==0)&(((time>20m)&(time<24m))|(time>28m)),1,0)
Ssp HVP LP SPC 0 SWF
Rsp LP 0 1300

* ---------- -HV output (follows) ----------
Bfn FNC 0 V=if((FLT==1)&(time>20m),0,1)
Sfn SN SND FNC 0 SWF
Dn SND 0 D_SEC
Coutn 0 HVN 33u Rser=20m
Rln 0 HVN 1143
Bsn SNC 0 V=if((FLT==0)&(time>24m),1,0)
Ssn 0 LN SNC 0 SWF
Rsn LN HVN 1300
.model SWF SW(Ron=10m Roff=100Meg Vt=0.5 Vh=0)

.model D_SNUB D(Is=10n Rs=0.1 N=1.5 Cjo=20p BV=150)
.model D_SEC D(Is=10n Rs=0.05 N=1.3 Cjo=30p tt=25n BV=600)

* ---------- directives ----------
.step param RUN list 1 3
.tran 0 42m
.save V(HVP) V(HVN) I(L1p) I(L2p)

.meas TRAN Vp_idle AVG V(HVP) FROM 19m TO 20m
.meas TRAN Vn_idle AVG V(HVN) FROM 19m TO 20m
.meas TRAN Vp_Pheavy AVG V(HVP) FROM 23m TO 24m
.meas TRAN Vn_Pheavy AVG V(HVN) FROM 23m TO 24m
.meas TRAN Vp_Nheavy AVG V(HVP) FROM 27m TO 28m
.meas TRAN Vn_Nheavy AVG V(HVN) FROM 27m TO 28m
.meas TRAN Vp_full AVG V(HVP) FROM 30m TO 31m
.meas TRAN Vn_full AVG V(HVN) FROM 30m TO 31m
.meas TRAN Vp_max MAX V(HVP) FROM 0 TO 31m
.meas TRAN Vn_min MIN V(HVN) FROM 0 TO 31m
.meas TRAN Mis_start MAX abs(V(HVP)+V(HVN)) FROM 0 TO 19m
.meas TRAN Mis_run MAX abs(V(HVP)+V(HVN)) FROM 19m TO 31m
.meas TRAN Mis_stop MAX abs(V(HVP)+V(HVN)) FROM 31m TO 42m
.meas TRAN Vn_min_fault MIN V(HVN) FROM 20m TO 31m
.meas TRAN Vp_max_fault MAX V(HVP) FROM 20m TO 31m
.meas TRAN Vp_end AVG V(HVP) FROM 41.9m TO 42m
.meas TRAN Vn_end AVG V(HVN) FROM 41.9m TO 42m
.meas TRAN I1_pk MAX I(L1p) FROM 30m TO 31m
.meas TRAN I2_pk MAX I(L2p) FROM 30m TO 31m
.end


